## Original Content
The 32nd Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) Small and Medium Enterprises (SME) Ministerial Meeting will be held on Sept. 4 in Guangzhou, south China's Guangdong Province, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT) said on Monday.

## Summary
The 32nd Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) Small and Medium Enterprises (SME) Ministerial Meeting is scheduled for September 4 in Guangzhou, China, as announced by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology. The meeting will emphasize innovation and cooperation among SMEs in the Asia-Pacific region.

## Key Points
- The meeting is the 32nd edition of the APEC SME Ministerial.
- It will be held on September 4 in Guangzhou, Guangdong Province, China.
- The focus is on innovation and cooperation for small and medium enterprises.
- The announcement was made by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology.


